# Concerted Effort ({2}{W}{W}): creatures you control gain protection until end of turn from whatever a creature you control has
# protection from - from a mana value too (CR 702.16a). Mistmeadow Skulk has protection from mana value 3 or greater, so at
# Bot1's upkeep on turn 5 the Grizzly Bears gains it. It attacks: Bot2's Gray Ogre (mana value 3, the limit) can't block it,
# while the Ornithopter (mana value 0) can (the control), and dies to it.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mistmeadow Skulk
Black Lotus
Grizzly Bears
Concerted Effort
Mox Emerald
Plains x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Mox Ruby
Gray Ogre
Ornithopter
Mountain
Mountain x10

